{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Lest he tear apart</b> — each one of my enemies, like: \"the daughters of the steppe trample upon me\"" "And the meaning of <b>he tears apart</b> — for the lion severs the neck-vertebra." "<b>And there is none to save</b> — only You; therefore above: <b>and save me.</b>"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:27.969484196Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}